-- alice's list says no empire: her next characters pick theirs
@1000 conn#9 accepted on auth from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#9: accepted on auth
@1000 conn#9 sends Hello protocol=3 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#9: openm2 test speaks protocol 3
   -> send conn#9 Welcome protocol=3
@1000 conn#9 sends StartSignIn
   -> send conn#9 SignInOptions [example] nonce="77d8b6ab9c5ec06d295a3c0e72732aec"
@1000 conn#9 sends ProviderLogin example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback
   -> check sign-in #17: example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback nonce=77d8b6ab9c5ec06d295a3c0e72732aec
@1000 sign-in #17 checked: https://id.example alice
   -> store #18: identity login example https://id.example alice
@1000 store answers #18: login ok, account 1 Some(1)
   -> event: conn#9: account 1 signed in with example
   -> send conn#9 SignedIn example:alice 502a… (32 bytes)
@1000 conn#9 closed: the client left
   -> event: conn#9: closed: the client left
@1000 conn#10 accepted on game from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#10: accepted on game
@1000 conn#10 sends Hello protocol=3 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#10: openm2 test speaks protocol 3
   -> send conn#10 Welcome protocol=3
@1000 conn#10 sends TicketLogin example:alice 502a… (32 bytes)
   -> event: conn#10: account 1 joined the game server
   -> store #19: load characters of 1
@1000 store answers #19: characters [0:Alice]
   -> send conn#10 Empire 0
   -> send conn#10 Phase 1
   -> send conn#10 CharacterList [0: #1 Alice lv1]
@1000 conn#10 sends CreateCharacter slot=1 Jin class=0 empire=3
   -> store #20: create Jin for 1 in slot 1 at (963400, 278200) empire 3
@1000 store answers #20: created #3 Jin in slot 1
   -> event: conn#10: character 3 created
   -> send conn#10 CharacterCreated slot=1 #3 Jin class=0 st=6 ht=4 dx=3 iq=3
   -> send conn#10 Empire 0
@1000 conn#10 sends CreateCharacter slot=2 Chun class=0 empire=2
   -> store #21: create Chun for 1 in slot 2 at (60000, 156000) empire 2
@1000 store answers #21: created #4 Chun in slot 2
   -> event: conn#10: character 4 created
   -> send conn#10 CharacterCreated slot=2 #4 Chun class=0 st=6 ht=4 dx=3 iq=3
   -> send conn#10 Empire 0
@1000 conn#10 sends CreateCharacter slot=3 Nowhere class=0 empire=7
   -> store #22: create Nowhere for 1 in slot 3 at (475000, 966100) empire 1
@1000 store answers #22: created #5 Nowhere in slot 3
   -> event: conn#10: character 5 created
   -> send conn#10 CharacterCreated slot=3 #5 Nowhere class=0 st=6 ht=4 dx=3 iq=3
